{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/src/knowledge/material-identity.ts",
    "title": "材料键如何定位数据库来源",
    "summary": "解释外部材料键与内部来源 ID 的显式别名、结构化回退规则，以及无冒号、多冒号和未命中时的真实行为。",
    "category": "代码机制",
    "topicPath": [
      "软件开发",
      "omem",
      "知识管理",
      "材料身份与历史引用"
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "purpose",
        "title": "为什么需要身份映射",
        "body": "知识文章可以长期保留导入时的外部材料键，而本地数据库用 `source_id` 标识来源。这里用持久化别名表连接两者：`material_key` 是唯一键，`source_id` 必填并引用 `sources`；建表采用 `IF NOT EXISTS`，可在初始化时重复调用。设计意图是依赖明确保存的导入数据，而不是从生产者名称猜测材料身份。参考 [[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "resolution",
        "title": "从材料键解析来源",
        "body": "调用 `sourceForMaterialKey(db, key)` 时，函数先检查别名表是否存在；若存在，就按完整材料键精确查询，命中后立即返回字符串形式的来源 ID。这样，新数据库可使用显式别名，未创建别名表的旧数据库也不会因直接查询不存在的表而失败。参考 [[c2]]\n\n别名未命中后，函数以**第一个冒号**切分键：冒号前作为 `namespace`，其后全部内容作为 `external`。随后查询同命名空间的来源，既接受 `external_id` 等于外部部分，也兼容 `external_id` 为空且来源自身 `id` 等于外部部分的记录；命中返回 ID，否则返回 `null`。参考 [[c3]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "boundaries",
        "title": "格式边界与修改入口",
        "body": "函数没有显式校验冒号。若键不含冒号，`indexOf` 得到 `-1`：按 JavaScript 的切片语义，`namespace` 会是去掉最后一个字符的键，`external` 则是完整键；函数仍用这两个值查询，查不到才返回 `null`，特殊数据组合也可能命中。若键含多个冒号，只有第一个是分隔符，其余冒号保留在 `external` 中。参考 [[c3]]\n\n因此，调整材料键格式时应同时审视切分语义与来源查询条件；若目标是拒绝无冒号输入，需要在切片前增加明确校验，而不能把当前的未命中结果当作格式验证。最终返回值只表达是否找到来源：找到时为字符串 ID，否则为 `null`。参考 [[c4]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "显式别名表",
        "reason": "支持外部键保留、显式持久化映射以及别名表字段约束的说明。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/knowledge/material-identity.ts",
          "startLine": 3,
          "endLine": 6
        },
        "quote": "/** Imported published knowledge may retain external keys. Aliases are explicit\n * persisted import data; the knowledge engine never interprets producer names. */\nexport function ensureMaterialAliases(db: DatabaseSync) {\n  db.exec(\"CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS knowledge_material_aliases(material_key TEXT PRIMARY KEY, sou"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "别名优先解析",
        "reason": "支持先检查别名表、再按完整材料键查询并立即返回来源 ID 的流程。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/knowledge/material-identity.ts",
          "startLine": 8,
          "endLine": 11
        },
        "quote": "export function sourceForMaterialKey(db: DatabaseSync, key: string): string | null {\n  if (db.prepare(\"SELECT 1 FROM sqlite_master WHERE type='table' AND name='knowledge_material_aliases'\").get()) {\n    const alias = db.prepare(\"SELECT source_id FROM knowledge_material_aliases WHERE material_key=?\").get(key);\n    if (a"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "结构化回退查询",
        "reason": "支持首个冒号切分、无冒号时仍执行切片，以及按命名空间和外部标识查询来源的说明。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/knowledge/material-identity.ts",
          "startLine": 13,
          "endLine": 14
        },
        "quote": "  const separator = key.indexOf(\":\"), namespace = key.slice(0, separator), external = key.slice(separator + 1);\n  const source = db.prepare(\"SELECT id FROM sources WHERE namespace=? AND (external_id=? OR (external_id IS NULL AND id=?))\").get(namespace, external, external);"
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "来源解析结果",
        "reason": "支持查询命中时返回字符串来源 ID、未命中时返回 null 的结论。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/knowledge/material-identity.ts",
          "startLine": 14,
          "endLine": 15
        },
        "quote": "  const source = db.prepare(\"SELECT id FROM sources WHERE namespace=? AND (external_id=? OR (external_id IS NULL AND id=?))\").get(namespace, external, external);\n  return source ? String(source.id) : null;"
      }
    ],
